1
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,200
We knew the world would not be the same.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,900
A few people laughed, a few people cried.

3
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,800
Most people were silent.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,500
<i>Now I am become Death, the destroyer of worlds.</i>

5
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Can you hear the music, Robert?

6
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:18,000
Yes, Professor. I can hear it clearly.

7
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:35,000
We must build the laboratory in the Los Alamos mesa.

8
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:40,000
It is remote, secret, and secure.

9
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:04,000
The countdown has commenced. Zero hour.
